# #549 fbctrlportkill -- THE AF2 ADJUDICATION PASS: every seat's pass-2 findings, my disposition on each

Project root C:\DocumentNoSnc\cc\GXEMUL; the tree is `GXEMUL-SEC/` (ignore any other `src/`).  **FIRST LINE:**
