* **Impact:** Both the probe header and gate 16 cite superseded Table 1 and the 20-variant count instead of Table 2 (22 of 22 variants red, [`table2/TABLE.out`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/regress/artifacts/fbctrlportkill_20260924/table2/TABLE.out)). They must be updated to cite Table 2 (`22 of 22`, `table2/TABLE.out`).

