* **Citation:** [`src/devices/dev_fbctrl.c:122-126`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_fbctrl.c#L122-L126), [`src/devices/dev_fbctrl.c:137-138`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_fbctrl.c#L137-L138)
* **Audit:**
