For the otherwise accepted D5/D8 designs, preserve their necessary ordering: D5 must retain GET_RESOLUTION through the tested refusal—D4’s NOP must not overwrite it beforehand—and COMMAND needs a valid command value rather than arbitrary fill. D8 must observe the selector before bank-scanning reselections erase that evidence.

